OL,3,AAngela Scanlon takes over Sara Cox's
OL,4,Adrivetime slot on Radio 2
OL,5,
OL,6,FAngela Scanlon is to take over BBC
OL,7,FRadio 2's drivetime show after Sara Cox
OL,8,Fmoved to the breakfast slot.
OL,10,FThe Irish personality said it was
OL,11,F"properly exciting" to be hosting the
OL,12,Fstation's 16:00-19:00 show every
OL,13,Fweekday from November.
OL,15,FShe said: "Millions of people, all
OL,16,Fhaving completely different days,
OL,17,Fpiling into the same conversation for a
OL,18,Ffew hours - what a strange and lovely
OL,19,Fthing!"
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
