OL,3,ACelebrity Traitors 2 cast: Who are this
OL,4,Ayear's 'big dogs' and dark horses?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCelebrity Traitors returns next week
OL,7,Ffor a second round of deception and
OL,8,Famateur detective work.
OL,10,FHosted by Claudia Winkleman, the
OL,11,FTraitors castle will welcome 21 new
OL,12,Fcelebrities on Thursday, as a group of
OL,13,Ffamous "faithfuls" attempts to work out
OL,14,Fwhich among them are - and perhaps,
OL,15,Falways have been - "traitors", secretly
OL,16,Fmurdering contestants each night.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
