OL,3,ACelebrity Traitors 2 cast: Who are this
OL,4,Ayear's 'big dogs' and dark horses?
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast year's show provided Bafta's most
OL,7,Fmemorable TV moment - an award voted
OL,8,Ffor by the British public - when
OL,9,Ftraitor Alan Carr broke down in tears
OL,10,Fat the end of the final having bluffed
OL,11,Fhis way to a win by hiding in plain
OL,12,Fsight.
OL,14,FLet's have a stab in the dark, then, at
OL,15,Fwho might follow in Jonathan Ross's
OL,16,Ffootsteps as this year's "big dog", and
OL,17,Fwho, like singer Cat Burns, could fly
OL,18,Funder the radar?
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
